      Download the public key from the service account signing key secret that the Kubernetes API server created by running the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc get secret/next-bound-service-account-signing-key \\\n  -n openshift-kube-apiserver-operator \\\n  -ojsonpath='{ .data.service-account\\.pub }' | base64 \\\n  -d > ${TEMPDIR}/serviceaccount-signer.public"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      <li>
