      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>--name</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Some parameters do not require real values because the <code>--dry-run</code> option does not make any API calls.</p></dd>
      </dl>
      </li>
      <li>
