      <h3 id="_rotating_azure_short_oidc_bound_service_account_signer_keys" class="group scroll-mt-20">Rotating Azure OIDC bound service account signer keys<a href="#_rotating_azure_short_oidc_bound_service_account_signer_keys" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
